  "title": "Build vs. buy for mobile release tooling: lessons from Monzo, Spotify, Tuist, and Etsy",
  "summary": "There's no clean threshold for when to build vs. buy mobile release tooling. In a live panel, senior engineers from Monzo, Spotify, Tuist, and Etsy explained why the real cost is ongoing maintenance and coordination — not the first build — and why AI accelerates that trap rather than removing it.",
